      "name": "Cave Generation",
      "desc": "Procedural cave generation using segments and weight logic to generate random caves. Client culling and mesh combining keep draw calls and part count low. Segments made by Legendary (Discord: legendary96).",
      "tags": [
        "Luau"
      ],
      "yt": "",
